{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using scvi_n200 encoder with avgpool aggregation, building on the prior multiprofile baseline (config_002). Validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275 suggest improved performance compared to the PCA-based config_002 (0.5907 accuracy). Uncertainty remains about the optimal RNA encoder choice and the potential benefits of image modality integration, as this setup excludes image encoders and fusion mechanisms."
}

